meta {
  name: Events - Answer - Clear
  type: http
  seq: 198
}

delete {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of an events space>/events/<cuid of an event>/answer
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Clears your answer to an event (#1515): 204, also when you did not answer. A Yes that goes frees a place. A cancelled event and an event that ended answer 422: their answers stay as they are. Limited per member (the event-answers limiter). Ability events:write.
}
